# No Cursor git attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or `cursoragent@cursor.com` to a commit.
- Commits in this repo are authored only as **samped** `<michaelsamuelpedro@gmail.com>`.
- Do not put Cursor, Auto, or any agent name in the author, committer, or message trailers.
- `scripts/commit-msg` and `scripts/prepare-commit-msg` strip those trailers. Do not bypass them with `--no-verify`.
